# Sao chép file này thành .env va dien gia tri that:
#   cp .env.example .env   (hoac copy thu cong tren Windows)
# File .env da duoc .gitignore -> KHONG bi commit/push (tranh lo secret).

# Groq API key — dung cho:
#   - Backend Groq Whisper (nhan dang giong noi nhanh)
#   - Buoc loc nhieu bang LLM (phan loai + chuan hoa transcript)
# Lay key tai: https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Ghi chu: proxy KHONG cau hinh o day. Neu muon nap proxy rieng,
# tao file proxies.txt o thu muc goc (moi dong mot proxy, vd http://host:port).
